  "title": "HTTP3: Fix quarter stream too big calculation",
  "description": "The shift is in the wrong direction. A QUIC stream ID is 62-bit, and\na Quarter Stream (stream ID divided by 4) is 60-bit. (Luckily the\nway the test is written, the fault results in never printing the expert\ninfo instead of resulting in always printing the expert info and\naborting.)\n\nCoverity CID 1662012",
